      "id": "erm.triggers.onbattlestackregeneration",
      "kind": "article",
      "section": "erm",
      "locale": "en",
      "slug": "triggers/onbattlestackregeneration",
      "url": "https://asmedian.github.io/modding-guide/en/erm/triggers/onbattlestackregeneration/",
      "title": "Stack regeneration amount (OnBattleStackRegeneration)",
      "summary": "x1 is stack 0..41; x2 mutable healing; x3 original standard healing. Result is clamped to 0..lost HP of the top creature. Can heal a stack without native regeneration, but cannot resurrect dead creatures. Distinct from OnBattleRegeneratePhase.",
      "keywords": [
        "OnBattleStackRegeneration",
        "77056"
      ],
      "questions": [
