      "id": "erm.triggers.onstacktostackdamage",
      "kind": "article",
      "section": "erm",
      "locale": "en",
      "slug": "triggers/onstacktostackdamage",
      "url": "https://asmedian.github.io/modding-guide/en/erm/triggers/onstacktostackdamage/",
      "title": "Stack-to-stack damage (OnStackToStackDamage)",
      "summary": "x1 attacker and x2 defender are global indices or -1. x3 is original final damage (read-only); x4 mutable final damage; x5 base damage; x6 bonus; x7 ranged flag (not defined on every path); x8 distance for theoretical calculations; x9 theoretical calculation (0/1). With x9=1 this serves previews or AI: do not grant rewards, kill stacks, or mutate game state.",
